    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a fundamental trait for individuals in the simulation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_base_trait" kindref="compound">BaseTrait</ref> inherits from <ref refid="class_trait" kindref="compound">Trait</ref> and includes functionality to:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Generate multiple traits from JSON configuration.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Retrieve trait identifiers.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Check trait properties such as inverse or strictly positive.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Handle serialization and temperature-dependent trait sections. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
